Product Authority (2026-10-13): the Cloudflare API token named **`lgfc-lite-token`** is the primary token for GitHub's connection to Cloudflare and must never be changed or deleted by accident. The design documents name the secret (`CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN`) but nowhere define the token itself, who depends on it, or what happens if it is revoked, rolled, expired or its permissions are edited. A reviewer reading Cloudflare's "last used: Feb 12, 2026" column would reasonably (and wrongly) call it dead; that nearly happened in session on 2026-10-13.

